Install node.js 24 LTS : curl -o- https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nvm-sh/nvm/v0.40.3/install.sh | bash
Then open terminal :  nvm install 24; nvm use 24
And to install all dependencies lacking :  npm ci

Install postgreSQL :  sudo apt update; sudo apt install postgresql postgresql-contrib

To test:
npm run db:init
npm run dev
